{"id":"f670de7b35b12e32bab588d4472e2862f1ffdf84","axis":"silent","repo":"graphql/graphql-js","sha":"f670de7b35b12e32bab588d4472e2862f1ffdf84","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".github/CONTRIBUTING.md","lines":["@@ -79,16 +79,29 @@ The documentation website is published from the `17.x.x` branch. Website source"," lives under `website/`, with general guides in `website/pages/docs` and upgrade"," guides in `website/pages/upgrade-guides`."," ","-The API reference pages are generated snapshots:","+The API reference pages under `website/pages/api-v*/` are generated during","+website builds and are not committed. The build uses the working tree for the","+current major and fetches the other documented release branches. Updates to","+those branches appear on the next website deployment. The production build","+includes the generated pages in `website/out`; the existing website deployment","+publishes that output. The build does not commit or push generated source files","+back to the release branches."," ","-- `website/pages/api-v16` is generated from a v16 source ref.","-- `website/pages/api-v17` is generated from a v17 source ref.","-","-Generate API docs from the website package:","+Install dependencies and build from the website package:"," "," ```bash"," cd website","-npm run generate:docs -- 16.x.x 17.x.x","+npm ci --ignore-scripts","+npm run build","+```","+","+Use `npm run dev` instead of `npm run build` to start the development server.","+Both commands generate API docs first and require network access.","+","+To generate API pages separately from `website/`, specify one or more source refs:","+","+```bash","+npm run generate:docs -- local"," ```"," "," Each argument is either `local` or a local git ref such as a branch, tag, SHA,","@@ -98,17 +111,6 @@ The generator infers the major version from each source's `package.json`, writes"," the corresponding `api-v*` output directory, and fails if more than one input"," resolves to the same major version."," ","-Use `local` when a PR changes API source comments or exported TypeScript","-surfaces and you want to regenerate docs before committing those source changes:","-","-```bash","-cd website","-npm run generate:docs -- 16.x.x local","-```","-","-Generated API docs are not published automatically at this time; PRs that","-change website API output must include the generated files.","-"," ### Executable API examples"," "," Run `npm run check:examples` to execute JSDoc `@example` code fences in `src`"],"additions":19,"deletions":17,"truncated":false},{"path":".gitignore","lines":["@@ -15,3 +15,4 @@ node_modules"," /denoDist"," /website/.next"," /website/out","+/website/pages/api-v*/"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":".prettierignore","lines":["@@ -1,4 +1,2 @@"," # additive to .gitignore"," /website/next-env.d.ts","-/website/pages/api-v16/**","-/website/pages/api-v17/**"],"additions":0,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"cspell.yml","lines":["@@ -9,8 +9,6 @@ ignorePaths:","   - benchmark/github-schema.json","   - website/icons","   - website/css","-  - website/pages/api-v16","-  - website/pages/api-v17"," overrides:","   - filename: 'eslint.config.*'","     words:"],"additions":0,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"eslint.config.mjs","lines":["@@ -24,6 +24,8 @@ export default defineConfig(","       'npmEsmDist',","       'denoDist',","       'website/.next',","+      'website/out',","+      'website/pages/api-v*',","       'integrationTests/ts/*.ts',","     ],","   },"],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"website/build-api.js","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@","+import { execFileSync } from 'node:child_process';","+import { readFileSync } from 'node:fs';","+import { join } from 'node:path';","+import { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';","+","+import meta from './pages/_meta.js';","+","+const websiteDir = fileURLToPath(new URL('.', import.meta.url));","+const { version, repository } = JSON.parse(","+  readFileSync(join(websiteDir, '../package